  "abstract": "This is an ablation study on the SOTA MoE-MLP model (ID 59). It tests the hypothesis that a version with fewer experts (4 instead of 8) can achieve a better score by training for more epochs within the time limit. The experiment aims to determine if the performance gains from deeper convergence outweigh the reduced specialization capacity of having fewer experts, seeking a better balance between model complexity and training efficiency.",
  "submitted_tick": 38,
